# INVWINMC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /MBOX:MBOX and no STATION= on a machine without a name, whose station
# would be CFG_DEFSTATION: the status bar names the mailbox, the link is
# refused before it opens, no file touched, and ENTER on the message box
# ends the program.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINMC.SNP is its snapshot.
S NOSTA
K ENTER
S GONE
